            "review_text": "Thomas C\n2 contributions\n0\nElegant dining with attention to detail\nNov 2025 • Family\nNHAN Eatery & Wine offers a quiet and refined dining experience in Hanoi. The space is intimate and thoughtfully designed, creating a comfortable atmosphere.\n\nThe dishes were beautifully presented and well balanced in taste. Ingredients felt fresh and carefully prepared. The wine pairing suggestions were appropriate and enhanced the meal.\n\nService was polite, attentive, and never intrusive. A very enjoyable experience overall. Recommended for those who appreciate calm surroundings and quality food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 30, 2026",
